<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dominion Resources upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dominion Resources upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had upgraded its rating for Dominion Resources Inc to near- and long-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 38-3/4 on Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
